#. macro: <string $gs1> — a text value passed to the string; value = global text 1 (the name of the player character) (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "quest/046/BanLop101_04687:TEXT_BANLOP101_04687_MANAGINGWAY_000_034:1"
msgid "I do hope you will assist us again, <split \" \" 1><string $gs1></split>. Please accept this small token of our appreciation."
msgstr "Надеюсь, вы и дальше будете нам помогать, <split \" \" 1><string $gs1></split>. Примите этот скромный знак нашей благодарности."
